            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article presents results of study concerning influence of desadaptive psychologic attitudes on formation and perception of pain syndrome in 148 vibration disease patients. The authors determined clinical and psychologic predictors of efficiency of pain syndrome treatment in vibration disease patients.</AbstractText>
